*.gif
!assets/*.gif
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Publish reviewed prose inside graded directories, never their code or outputs.
!**/labs/*graded*/
**/labs/*graded*/*
!**/labs/*graded*/CAPTURE.md
